       (sd = 1.000 exactly if samples were independent Exp(1))
  POI: 156 blocks;  mean (K-1)*sqrt(M) = +0.1455;  sd = 0.9725   =>  dof_eff/dof_nom = 1.057
       (sd = 1.000 exactly if samples were independent Exp(1))

  -> error-bar inflation factor adopted from CUE: 0.971

